(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-35","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["第一闸只开[[modest|适中的]]幅度，季禾看着自己[[cast|浇铸]]的接头，清晨的[[frost|霜]]在铜上消了。顾衡要[[utilize|利用]]旁边小沟分担冲力，沟底[[sticky|黏]]泥必须先清。每户的[[portion|份额]]仍待[[settle|核算]]，送水[[vehicle|车辆]]不能在闸边乱停。沈砚蹲下[[scrape|刮去]]旧刻上的泥，有人赞他们来[[civilize|教化]]这座城，他摇头：城里本有能守井的人，是他们的水被收走。工队的[[stress|压力]]在修通之后没变少，因为一旦急着把全部水放出，低屋先遭淹的也是同一群人。","低屋住着卖[[dairy|乳品]]的人和旧[[navy|海军]]船工，他们的[[influence|影响力]]不足以先上议席。罗清从门缝[[glimpse|瞥见]]一个老人，在床上等水。经验丰富的[[veteran|老手]]带青年试闸，不许顾衡对村人的担心[[indifferent|冷漠]]。沈砚的手痛牵着[[nerve|神经]]，只能在旁记量；罗清处理[[acute|严重的]]虚弱，让第一车先[[reach|到达]]低屋。水不是谁的[[kingdom|王国]]，各户[[various|不同的]]生计都要留下余地。每桶来源标清，昨日红票不再作为今日是否配给的凭证。","税吏将陶溯拘入[[gaol|牢房]]，依据是拆运原票与售水假清洗印，不是群众骂声。掌事旧[[ban|禁令]]暂停，不能让病者继续[[suffer|受苦]]。许庭以[[diplomatic|有手腕的]]说法请高[[rank|身份]]买家先提盐，一[[gang|群]]工人拦车却没拿起[[ax|斧子]]。沈砚请按已付货款与救急需要排次序，未到的家户由邻人留份。远处有人[[applause|鼓掌]]，季禾提醒先把今天水位写下：一阵高兴不能[[prove|证明]]新渠稳固，倘若它[[affect|影响]]下游旧井，他们仍要修正，不能只因刚做成便拒听坏消息。","顾衡不把自己的[[popularity|名望]]写上配水单。许庭的[[tropical|热带的]]香料受潮，要求[[partner|合伙人]]分损，态度[[somewhat|稍微]]缓了一点，仍不是无私的人。沈砚认真听他[[earnest|诚恳的]]那部分，再将毁损与救急租金分开。船工在[[deck|甲板]]上听到远处[[thunder|雷声]]，收紧米袋。一枚[[rare|罕见的]]旧渠印绑着[[ribbon|缎带]]，是城中祭司保存的地图封签。沈砚将两处封蜡对照，图与水中残片属于[[homogeneous|同一种的]]印料，上游几个山门曾共同签过通水，不是城里凭空伸手要山的水。","众人的[[anxiety|焦虑]]未全退去，医馆还留着[[real|真实的]]欠款和病者姓名。河上[[fog|雾]]起，顾衡说今天不因[[lucky|好运]]才未出事故，是工人停过一次闸。配水人之间仍有[[clash|冲突]]，罗清让两位[[capable|能胜任的]]家属轮替记水，不把[[burden|重担]]永远压给同一个人。季禾保持[[alert|警觉]]，夜班先学看接头再上岗。今日城外两个小村也来索水，沈砚不能再说你们不在我的契里。祭司拿出旧公约尾页，注明各口不得以修炼为名断下游饮用，这条是原本有的承诺。","这份承诺让顾衡想起自己的山门。他并未来孤城就能替所有山门作保证，只答应带证据回去公开问。罗清留六名学徒与城中医者继续照护，不将尚未康复的人带上山去作证。腿伤工人退热后仍不能走，季禾向他告别，答应把旧欠薪的回单带回来。下游盐扣已在联署测量后放行，许庭按原货号归还货，承担自己误收的一项运费。车队只带核好的图票与封蜡返程。旧渠虽然通了，水线显示更上游仍限流；他们要把城里真做过的事和没做完的账一同带回钟楼。"],"en":["The gate opened a [[modest|modest]] amount through Ji’s [[cast|cast]] connector as [[frost|frost]] melted. Gu would [[utilize|utilize]] a side channel after removing [[sticky|sticky]] mud. Each [[portion|portion]] still needed accounting to [[settle|settle]] claims; a [[vehicle|vehicle]] must not block the gate. Shen began to [[scrape|scrape]] old marks. He rejected praise for coming to [[civilize|civilize]] the city: local keepers already knew their work. [[stress|Stress]] remained because a full rush could flood low homes.","The low homes housed [[dairy|dairy]] sellers and an old [[navy|navy]] sailor with little [[influence|influence]]. Luo caught a [[glimpse|glimpse]] of a waiting elder. A [[veteran|veteran]] trained workers and rejected an [[indifferent|indifferent]] response to concerns. Shen’s [[nerve|nerve]] pain limited him to records. Luo attended [[acute|acute]] weakness as water began to [[reach|reach]] low homes first. No private [[kingdom|kingdom]] owned the supply; [[various|various]] livelihoods needed space. Old red tickets no longer decided entitlement.","Officials took Tao to [[gaol|gaol]] on original removal receipts and false cleaning seals, not shouts. His [[ban|ban]] was suspended so patients need not [[suffer|suffer]] further. Xu used [[diplomatic|diplomatic]] phrasing to favour high-[[rank|rank]] buyers. A [[gang|gang]] of workers blocked him without lifting an [[ax|ax]]. Shen used paid orders and urgent need, reserving absent households’ shares. [[applause|Applause]] sounded, but did not [[prove|prove]] safe operation. If the canal would [[affect|affect]] lower wells, they still owed correction.","Gu left his [[popularity|popularity]] off the sheets. Xu requested a [[partner|partner]] share damp [[tropical|tropical]] cargo losses. [[somewhat|Somewhat]] calmer, he remained self-interested. Shen heard the [[earnest|earnest]] part and separated losses from hire. A sailor secured sacks on [[deck|deck]] at [[thunder|thunder]]. A [[rare|rare]] old channel seal on a [[ribbon|ribbon]] matched the priest’s map. Its material and the floating fragment were [[homogeneous|homogeneous]]: upstream sects had once signed shared flow.","[[anxiety|Anxiety]] remained alongside [[real|real]] debts and patient names. Under [[fog|fog]], Gu said safety had not merely been [[lucky|lucky]]: workers had stopped once. A distribution [[clash|clash]] required two [[capable|capable]] families rotating the [[burden|burden]]. Ji stayed [[alert|alert]] and trained night workers. Two outside villages requested water. Shen could not dismiss them as absent from his own deed. The old covenant explicitly forbade cutting downstream drinking supplies for cultivation.","Gu would carry evidence home, not promise on every sect’s behalf. Luo left six apprentices with city healers and did not force recovering people to travel as witnesses. Ji’s friend was free of fever but unable to walk; Ji promised wage receipts. Joint surveys had freed detained salt, which Xu returned by original numbers, refunding one improper fee. The party took checked maps, papers and seals towards the tower. Local flow was restored, but upstream limits persisted. They carried both completed work and unpaid obligations home."]});
